          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പുറപ്പെടൽ — puṟappeṭal — \"departure\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വിമാനത്തിന്റെ പുറപ്പെടൽ രാത്രി പത്ത് മണിക്കാണ്. vimānattinṟe puṟappeṭal rātri pattŭ maṇikkāṇŭ. The flight's departure is at ten at night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The noun of പുറപ്പെടുക, to set out: the ending -അൽ turns a verb into a noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പുറപ്പെടൽ (puṟappeṭal) is native Malayalam, the verbal noun of പുറപ്പെടുക, to set out, which is built on പുറം, the outside (DEDR 4333), with the ending -അൽ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
