          "title": "You'll want to know: കാലതാമസം",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കാലതാമസം — kālatāmasaṁ — \"a delay\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മഴ കാരണം തീവണ്ടിക്ക് രണ്ട് മണിക്കൂർ കാലതാമസം ഉണ്ടായി. maḻa kāraṇaṁ tīvaṇṭikkŭ raṇṭŭ maṇikkūr kālatāmasaṁ uṇṭāyi. Because of the rain the train had a two-hour delay."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A formal word, common in announcements; in speech people say വൈകി, it is late."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കാലതാമസം (kālatāmasaṁ) is a Malayalam compound built from കാലം, time, and താമസം, delay, both borrowed from Sanskrit: kāla, time, and tāmasa, \"dark, sluggish\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
